<title>UK: EIB sets 20 billion escudo 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 20 billion escudo 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Banco Cisf, Banco Portugues de Investimento and Caixa Geral de Depositos.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN PTE    BASE     *3M-LISBOR  MATURITY    15.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     *FLAT     PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.125   FULL FEES   0.23</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     PORTUGAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*SUBJECT TO A CAP OF 9.25 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
